"update": 1,
"values": ["", "Greetings, operatives.", "", "A technological", "", "marvel called the Dragonbowl Airship is", "", "visiting Waterdeep as part", "of a deplorable underground fighting tournament, ", "run ", "", "and patroned by criminal factions.", "", "This", "", "quest, should you choose to accept it,", "", "involves stealing the dirigible's ", "", "blueprints, which are on board the vessel.", "", "Meet with Harpers' representative,", "", "Mirt,", "", "in Box C at the Lightsinger Theatre", "", "tonight during the interval", "", "for a full", "", "debriefing.", "Formal attire required.", ""]
}

